   <refbody><section><p>The markdown folder structure converts to the DITA map or book map in the following ways:</p>
<table frame="all" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
            <title>Markdown conversion mapping</title>
            <tgroup cols="2">
               <colspec colname="c1"/>
               <colspec colname="c2"/>
               <thead>
                  <row>
                     <entry>Markdown structure</entry>
                     <entry>DITA output</entry>
                  </row>
               </thead>
               <tbody>
                  <row>
                     <entry>folder</entry>
                     <entry>DITA map node</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>root folder index.md</entry>
                     <entry>primary DITA topic</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>Subfolder index.md</entry>
                     <entry>child topicref</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>Sibling folders index.md</entry>
                     <entry>sibling topicref</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>Heading 2 (<codeph>##</codeph>)-Penultimate Heading</entry>
                     <entry>grandchild topicref</entry>
                  </row>
                  <row>
                     <entry>images folder</entry>
                     <entry>DITA media folder</entry>
                  </row>
               </tbody>
            </tgroup>
         </table></section></refbody>
